          <h1 class="title">Climate Committee</h1>                                        <div class="content-before">
            <div class="content-inner">
              <div id="block-views_blocks-term-block_1-3" class=" fif-rt fiw-50 no-2col-lists  dd block block-views_blocks region-odd odd region-count-1 count-5 overview views-block channel context-template "><div class="block-inner">

    
   
  
  
  <div class="block-content content">
    <div class="view view-term view-id-term view-display-id-block_1 view-dom-id-term-block-1-1">
    
  
  
      <div class="view-content">
        <div class="views-row views-row-1 views-row-odd views-row-first views-row-last">
    <article id="node-2127-teaser" class="  h3accordion  dd node node-teaser node-type-post node-2127 pt-show-social-block no-event-date t1 wt1 wt0 t376 wt376 wt198 wt182 wt0 access-normal has-file has-files has-image no-more pt1 has-1-nt">
    <div class="node-inner">
        <div class="node-upper-meta meta node-item">
      <div class='meta-inner'>
        <span class='meta-item post-type' data-plural='Overviews'>Overview</span> <span class='last meta-item post-date'><time datetime="2019-11-25T09:47:00">November 25, 2019</time></span>           </div>
    </div>
            <h2 class="node-header node-item">
      <a href="/climate-committee" title="Climate Committee">
        <span class="title">Climate Committee</span>
              </a>
    </h2>
        <div class="node-image node-item">
      <span class="field-image field-not-video field-image-preset-thumbnail croppable  c1  c-1"><a href="/climate-committee" rel="" aria-label="Read more"><img src="/sites/main/files/imagecache/thumbnail/main-images/climate_change_image.jpg?1576864651" alt="" title="" loading="lazy"  width="803" height="550" /></a></span>    </div>
        <div class="node-content content node-item">
      <p>
  The City has embarked on a project to develop a Climate Action
  and Adaptation Plan. A Climate Committee has been established
  that meets on a regular basis to develop and review this plan.
</p>
<p>
  The Committee’s Mission Statement is:&nbsp;We will assess the
  threats and challenges of climate change as they relate to our
  community by seeking input from experts and local constituents.
  We will use these inputs to develop actionable plans to mitigate
  those threats and educate the community.
</p>
<p>
  Please see below the documents and information shared at each
  meeting. If you would like to be added to the Climate Project
  distribution list to get information about upcoming meetings,
  please email <a href=
  "mailto:mbilse@ci.carmel.ca.us">mbilse@ci.carmel.ca.us</a>.
</p>
<p>
  Check out the <a href=
  "/post/coastal-adaptation-project-sea-level-rise-update">Coastal
  Adaptation Project & Sea Level Rise Update page</a> for project
  updates, public documents, opportunities for community
  participation, and materials from public workshops and meetings
</p>
<h5>
  <span class="file fid-4640 file-carmel-climate-adaptation-plan-prefinal-042822-pdf file-application-pdf  c1  c-1"><a href="/sites/main/files/file-attachments/carmel_climate_adaptation_plan_prefinal_042822.pdf?1656629980" style=" background-image: url(&#039;https://ci.carmel.ca.us/sites/all/modules/filefield/icons/application-pdf.png&#039;); "><span class="link-text">CLIMATE ADAPTATION PLAN - Final Draft, July 2022</span></a></span>
</h5>
<p>
  <strong><span class="file fid-4641 file-climate-adaptation-plan-appendixa-climate-action-plan-prefinal-042822-pdf file-application-pdf  c1  c-1"><a href="/sites/main/files/file-attachments/climate_adaptation_plan_appendixa_climate_action_plan_prefinal_042822.pdf?1656630014" style=" background-image: url(&#039;https://ci.carmel.ca.us/sites/all/modules/filefield/icons/application-pdf.png&#039;); "><span class="link-text">Appendix A - CLIMATE ACTION PLAN - Final Draft, July 2022</span></a></span></strong>
</p>
<p>
  <strong><span class="file fid-4642 file-climate-adaptation-plan-appendixb-vuln-assesst-pdf file-application-pdf  c1  c-1"><a href="/sites/main/files/file-attachments/climate_adaptation_plan_appendixb_vuln_assesst.pdf?1651195961" style=" background-image: url(&#039;https://ci.carmel.ca.us/sites/all/modules/filefield/icons/application-pdf.png&#039;); "><span class="link-text">Appendix B - VULNERABILITY ASSESSMENT - July 2021</span></a></span></strong>
</p>
<p>
  <strong><span class="file fid-4643 file-climate-adaptation-plan-appendixc-outreach-pdf file-application-pdf  c1  c-1"><a href="/sites/main/files/file-attachments/climate_adaptation_plan_appendixc_outreach.pdf?1651196066" style=" background-image: url(&#039;https://ci.carmel.ca.us/sites/all/modules/filefield/icons/application-pdf.png&#039;); "><span class="link-text">Appendix C - Outreach</span></a></span></strong>
